WEBVTT

00:01:57.863 --> 00:02:00.063
for 69 million dollars

00:02:00.063 --> 00:02:04.363
is the same tool that will allow
our students to make livings

00:02:04.397 --> 00:02:05.863
as freelance creators.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.130
There is a paradigm shift happening

00:02:09.163 --> 00:02:12.130
that is turning the world
of content creation

00:02:12.163 --> 00:02:14.030
and its financial rewards on its head.

00:02:14.697 --> 00:02:18.530
Gone are the days of the internet
being a giant copying machine,

00:02:18.563 --> 00:02:22.963
of intermediaries taking
a larger cut than the creators,

00:02:22.997 --> 00:02:25.530
and of artists not receiving royalties.

00:02:26.197 --> 00:02:28.330
This new automated tool

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:33.397
that allows for guaranteed proof
of origination and ownership